From: Smartisan ODIN mainline porting effort
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] msm8953: drop markw and rosy from the device table

Force lk2nd to pick the Smartisan ODIN entry —— 只有命中 odin，
占位 compatible 才会被替换成真实面板名。

本补丁按 **lk2nd 21.0** 的设备表重新生成。21.0 与 23.x 的差异：
  - 21.0 是 msm8953-billion-rimob（23.x 改名成 flipkart-rimob）
  - 21.0 没有 meizu-m1871 / qrd-sku3 / wingtech-wt89536 / sdm450-mtp
按 23.x 生成的那份打到 21.0 上会 Hunk #1 FAILED。

--- a/lk2nd/device/dts/msm8953/rules.mk
+++ b/lk2nd/device/dts/msm8953/rules.mk
@@ -16,13 +16,11 @@
 	$(LOCAL_DIR)/msm8953-smartisan-odin.dtb \
 	$(LOCAL_DIR)/msm8953-xiaomi-common.dtb \
 	$(LOCAL_DIR)/msm8953-xiaomi-daisy.dtb \
-	$(LOCAL_DIR)/msm8953-xiaomi-markw.dtb \
 	$(LOCAL_DIR)/msm8953-xiaomi-oxygen.dtb \
 	$(LOCAL_DIR)/msm8953-xiaomi-vince.dtb \
 	$(LOCAL_DIR)/sdm450-motorola-ali.dtb \
 	$(LOCAL_DIR)/sdm450-samsung-r04.dtb \
 	$(LOCAL_DIR)/sdm450-samsung-r05.dtb \
-	$(LOCAL_DIR)/sdm450-xiaomi-rosy.dtb \
 	$(LOCAL_DIR)/sdm632-fairphone-fp3.dtb \
 	$(LOCAL_DIR)/sdm632-motorola-ocean.dtb \
 	$(LOCAL_DIR)/sdm632-mtp.dtb \
